01:49:35.700 --> 01:49:43.130
I will also put some links to specific meditations
on that page, in the show notes at tim.blog/podcast.

01:49:43.130 --> 01:49:45.050
And thank you so much for taking the time
Jack.

01:49:45.050 --> 01:49:49.920
It's always such a pleasure, such a joy and
so helpful to me personally, to spend time

01:49:49.920 --> 01:49:50.920
with you.

01:49:50.920 --> 01:49:55.550
Jack Kornfield: Well, for me too, I've enjoyed
