01:50:03.790 --> 01:50:04.790
I appreciate that.

01:50:04.790 --> 01:50:05.950
Jack Kornfield: Yeah.

01:50:05.950 --> 01:50:06.950
Live well.

01:50:06.950 --> 01:50:08.120
Tim Ferriss: Thank you.

01:50:08.120 --> 01:50:09.470
Take care, Jack.

01:50:09.470 --> 01:50:10.020
